    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70891" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῐφ-ετός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>falling snow, snowstorm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμβρον . . ἠὲ χάλαζαν ἢ νιφετόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ νιφετός, οὔτ᾽ ἂρ χειμὼν πολὺς
					οὔτε ποτ᾽ ὄμβρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.566
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				107.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.98
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				349a9
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				199.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Adule</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				6.267
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.260
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. λημμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					57.48
				</span></i>
			.</div>
